stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> queued : POST returns an id, no model call
    queued --> running : worker runs in after(), response already flushed

    state running {
        direction TB
        facts : fact pass — resolves every cap
        dims : 12 dimensions — commit then heartbeat, each one
        synth : synthesis — the brief
        facts --> dims
        dims --> synth
    }

    running --> succeeded : contract stored whole
    running --> failed : no heartbeat for 120s, swept ON READ
    failed --> queued : re-paste resets the row — SAME id, same URL
    succeeded --> [*] : immutable

    note right of queued
        The operator can close the tab.
        Scoring continues on the server.
    end note

    note right of failed
        Says how many dimensions landed
        and how long ago. Never a spinner.
    end note
